<div id="auth_modal" class="modal_overlay hidden">
    <div class="modal_content">
        <span id="close_modal" class="close_btn">
            <svg id="featured_details_svg" width="20px" height="20px"><image width="20px" height="20px" href="/images/icon_close.svg"></image></svg>
        </span>
        <div id="logged_out_view">
            <h2>Join StellaView</h2>
            <form id="register_form">
                <div id="name_fields">
                    <input type="text" id="first_name" placeholder="First Name" required>
                    <input type="text" id="last_name" placeholder="Last Name" required>
                </div>
                <div id="information_fields">
                    <input type="email" id="email_input" placeholder="Email" required>
                    <input type="password" id="password_input" placeholder="Password" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="cta_btn">Create Account</button>
            </form>
            <div class="auth_divider">
                <span>OR</span>
            </div>
            <div class="login_options">
                <a href="/api/user/auth/google" class="google_btn">
                    <svg width="25px" height="25px" viewBox="0 0 25 25"><image alt="Google Logo" width="25px" height="25px" href="/images/login_google.svg"></image></svg>
                    <span>Sign in with Google</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#" id="toggle_auth_mode">Log In</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="logged_in_view" class="hidden">
            <h2 id="welcome_user">Welcome</h2>
            <div class="logged_in_buttons">
                <button id="settings_btn" class="cta_btn secondary">Settings</button>
                <button id="logout_btn" class="cta_btn secondary">Sign Out</button>
            </div>
            <a href="#" id="open_tos_link">Terms and Services</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div id="settings_modal" class="modal_overlay hidden">
    <div class="settings_large settings_background">
        <span id="close_settings" class="close_btn">
            <svg width="20px" height="20px"><image width="20px" height="20px" href="/images/icon_close.svg"></image></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="settings_view">
            <h2>Stargazing Preferences</h2>
            <p>Personalize your stargazing site recommendations.</p>

            <form id="settings_form">
                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_max_drive"><b>Max Drive:</b> <span id="val_max_drive">60</span> mins</label>
                    <input type="range" min="15" value="60" class="slider" id="pref_max_drive">
                </div>

                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_max_bortle"><b>Max Bortle Class:</b> <span id="val_max_bortle">3</span></label>
                    <input type="range" min="1" max="5" value="3" class="slider" id="pref_max_bortle">
                </div>

                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_min_temp"><b>Minimum Temperature:</b> <span id="val_min_temp">20</span> °F</label>
                    <input type="range" min="0" max="60" value="20" class="slider" id="pref_min_temp">
                </div>

                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_max_temp"><b>Maximum Temperature:</b> <span id="val_max_temp">80</span> °F</label>
                    <input type="range" min="60" max="120" value="80" class="slider" id="pref_max_temp">
                </div>

                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_latest_stay"><b>Stay Out Until:</b> <span id="val_latest_stay">2:00 AM</span></label>
                    <input type="time" value="02:00" id="pref_latest_stay">
                </div>

                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_lead_time"><b>Prep Time:</b> <span id="val_lead_time">30</span> mins</label>
                    <input type="range" min="1" max="60" value="30" class="slider" id="pref_lead_time">
                </div>

                <div class="settings_group">
                    <label for="pref_fallback_loc"><b>Home Location:</b></label>
                    <textarea id="pref_fallback_loc" placeholder="(eg. Yosemite, California)"></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="cta_btn submit">Save Preferences</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div id="tos_modal" class="modal_overlay hidden">
    <div class="settings_large settings_services">
        <span id="close_tos" class="close_btn">
            <svg width="20px" height="20px"><image width="20px" height="20px" href="/images/icon_close.svg"></image></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="settings_view">
            <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
            <p>Last Updated: April 2026</p>

            <div class="settings_group">
                <h3>1. Attribution & Open Source</h3>
                <p>StellaView is built upon and made possible by the following open-source projects and data providers. We thank these contributors for making this data accessible:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Weather & AQI:</b> Forecast data provided by <a href="https://open-meteo.com/" target="_blank">Open-Meteo</a>.</li>
                    <li><b>Map Engine:</b> Built with <a href="https://leafletjs.com/" target="_blank">Leaflet</a> and <a href="https://www.tensorflow.org/js" target="_blank">TensorFlow.js</a>.</li>
                    <li><b>Geocoding & POIs:</b> Search and location data provided by <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors via Nominatim and the Overpass API.</li>
                    <li><b>Routing:</b> Drive time estimations calculated using the <a href="http://project-osrm.org/" target="_blank">OSRM Project</a>.</li>
                    <li><b>Basemaps:</b> Dark Matter tiles by <a href="https://carto.com/attributions" target="_blank">CARTO</a>.</li>
                    <!--<li><b>Code Storage:</b> Storage and open sourced code managed through <a href="https://github.com/AndrewMulert/stellaview" target="_blank">Github</a>.</li>-->
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="settings_group">
                <h3>2. Data Privacy & Storage</h3>
                <p>To provide personalized recommendations to our users, StellaView stores the following information:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Account Data:</b> Name, email, and profile picture (retrieved via Google Auth or registration).</li>
                    <li><b>Preferences:</b> Your set home location, maximum drive time, Bortle scale limits, and temperature ranges.</li>
                    <li><b>Activity:</b> Your favorited sites and a rolling history of your five most recent searches.</li>
                </ul>
                <p><i>Note: We do not store real-time GPS data from your device. All location-based recommendations are calculated relative to your manually set "Home Location" or your location as access is given via web browsers and device settings.</i></p>
            </div>

            <div class="settings_group">
                <h3>3. Prediction Disclaimer</h3>
                <p>Clear-sky predictions are estimates generated by a proprietary algorithm. Atmospheric conditions, local light pollution changes, and satellite data latency mean these results are not 100% guaranteed. Always cross-reference with live satellite imagery before traveling.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="settings_group">
                <h3>4. User Safety & Conduct</h3>
                <p>Users are responsible for their own safety. StellaView does not verify the current physical accessibility or safety of recommended sites. You must adhere to all local trespassing laws, park hours, and safety regulations. You are also responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>